theoretical_foundation = "Driven oscillations near a natural frequency can grow when damping is small. Superposition changes displacement; destructive interference does not destroy energy. Overlapping driven waves can focus energy locally. Terminal speed is a balance of driving and drag forces, not a universal maximum speed."
